 ],
 "synopsis": "Global private equity firm Advent International has launched the sale process for its portfolio firm DFM Foods, a packaged snacks maker popular for its brand Crax, aiming for an exit after nearly seven years of investment. Advent International is expecting a valuation in excess of $400 million for DFM Foods, with initial bids expected later in October. Multiple suitors, including private equity funds and strategic players, are evaluating the opportunity. Avendus Capital and EY have been picked as sell-side advisors for the transaction.",
